{"id":"589a33fb3aa7798d","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-cor-brouwer.md","title":"Brouwer Fixed Point Theorem","display":"cor-brouwer — Brouwer Fixed Point Theorem","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-brouwer","aliases":["58-cor-brouwer"],"display":"cor-brouwer — Brouwer Fixed Point Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-disk.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-brouwer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-brouwer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-brouwer — Brouwer Fixed Point Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"617975928ef03517\" href=\"?note=617975928ef03517\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-disk.md\">../batch02/58-df-disk.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n=D^n(0,1)\">\\(D^n=D^n(0,1)\\)</span> is the closed unit disk (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"617975928ef03517\" href=\"?note=617975928ef03517\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-disk.md\">../batch02/58-df-disk.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_D\">\\(\\tau_D\\)</span> is the Euclidean subspace topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^n\">\\(D^n\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\)</span> is the typed continuous-map predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}brouwer} \\vdash \\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,D^n,\\tau_D,D^n,\\tau_D)\\to \\exists x\\in D^n\\;(f(x)=x)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}brouwer} \\vdash \\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,D^n,\\tau_D,D^n,\\tau_D)\\to \\exists x\\in D^n\\;(f(x)=x)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Brouwer: every continuous self-map of a disk has a fixed point.</li>\n<li>It is foundational in game theory and economics.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-disk.md","status":"resolved","id":"617975928ef03517","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-disk.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-disk.md","status":"resolved","id":"617975928ef03517","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}$ and $D^n=D^n(0,1)$ is the closed unit disk (see [[../batch02/58-df-disk.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S$ is the typed continuous-map predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D^n=D^n(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_D","display":false},{"tex":"D^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}brouwer} \\vdash \\forall f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,D^n,\\tau_D,D^n,\\tau_D)\\to \\exists x\\in D^n\\;(f(x)=x)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":925,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-cor-brouwer.md|58-cor-brouwer]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["617975928ef03517","44867449c3df728b"]}